   7+ 0000              ; WIN1 ($4000-$7FFF), PG1/page #03: ROM-return trampoline at $4000,
   8+ 0000              ;   Z80 stack at $4FFE with guard $4800-$487F, DMA frame at $5000-$7FFF.
