 410++1316              ; BIOS INT 16h keyboard services.
 411++1316              ; The physical Spectrum/ATM keyboard bridge is not implemented yet. During
 412++1316              ; BIOS startup, expose one synthetic Enter key (scan 1Ch, ASCII 0Dh).
 413++1316              ; AH=00/10 read it; AH=01/11 report it without consuming it. Once consumed,
 414++1316              ; a blocking read returns NUL rather than hanging the entire NeoGS command.
 415++1316              ; AH=02 returns zero keyboard shift flags.
