1241+ 15D8              ; The 16-bit ALU and interrupt core are resident, not in the tight bank-68
1242+ 15D8              ; interpreter overlay. They execute while bank 68 is mapped and may call
1243+ 15D8              ; its fetch/next/stack helpers directly. This frees several KiB in overlay68
1244+ 15D8              ; for opcode handlers without introducing extra bank-switch gateways.
